## Third-party content

Everything under `Launcher/`, `SD_Card_T-Embed/`, `Drivers_Windows/`,
`Ferramentas_Flash/`, `Documentacao/`, and `Bibliotecas_Dev/` was sourced
from third-party repositories and keeps its original license — notably,
the Bruce firmware installed through the Launcher is AGPL-3.0
([BruceDevices/firmware](https://github.com/BruceDevices/firmware)). See
CONTRIBUTING.md for the full table. When in doubt about a specific file's
license, consult the linked source repository directly.
